    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG is truly honoured to bring this substantial, detached family home to the market extending to approximately 380sq.m/4,090sq.ft. perfectly positioned in a much sought after sylvan setting in the heart of Foxrock. Newlands is approached by a gated gravelled driveway providing ample secure off-street parking.\n\nUpon entering this stunning property, one will experience luxury living, boasting gracious reception rooms, five spacious double bedrooms including a most impressive master suite incorporating an ensuite bathroom, dressing room and walk-in wardrobe. This property offers ample space for a growing family and those who love to entertain. The property is complimented by a most appealing landscaped lawned rear garden bordered by mature hedging, trees and planting, enjoying complete privacy, complimented by a raised paved patio which spans the width of the property. A truly tranquil retreat for quiet relaxation, inviting al fresco dining and a perfect setting for hosting outdoor gatherings. \n\nThe superbly presented interiors of the property are thoughtfully designed combining calm neutral colour tones with modern finishes and high-quality fixtures and fittings throughout. The graciously proportioned layout creates a seamless flow between living and bedroom spaces, ideal for both everyday living and special occasions. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises of a gracious reception hall, a most inviting drawing/dining room spanning the depth of the property with double doors leading out to the patio and garden, a most impressive open plan split level family/dining/kitchen with picture perfect views over the garden, a bespoke fitted home office, guest w.c. and utility room complete the accommodation at this level. On the first floor, a light infused landing leads to four graciously proportioned double bedrooms (2 ensuite) and a family bathroom. A staircase leads from the spacious landing up to the master suite comprising of a bedroom, ensuite bathroom, dressing room and walk-in wardrobe.\n\nIdeally located in the leafy suburb of Foxrock and only a short stroll from Foxrock Village. This quaint village enjoys a selection of popular eateries, restaurants and specialist shops. More extensive shopping amenities are located in nearby Stillorgan village, Dunnes Stores at Cornelscourt and Carrickmines Retail Park which are close by. Foxrock Golf Club is a short distance away as is the driving range at Leopardstown Golf Club and Carrickmines Croquet and Lawn Tennis Club. \n\nAn excellent selection of primary schools nearby include Hollypark and St. Brigid's Boys and Girls National Schools. Many of South County Dublin's finest secondary schools are within an easy commute including Blackrock College, Mount Anville, Loreto Foxrock, as well as Nord Anglia International School and St Andrew's College. Third level colleges are also within easy reach.\n\nViewing is highly recommended not to miss out on the opportunity to make this unique property your new home. Contact us today to arrange a viewing and start your next chapter in luxury living."
      },
