        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \nCeiling coving, partly panelled walls, recessed and wall lighting, understairs storage, tiled flooring.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 11.89m x 4.51m\nCeiling coving, bay window, timber flooring, recessed lighting, t.v. point, dual aspect with double doors leading out to patio and garden.\n\nOpen Plan Family/Dining/Kitchen - \n\n\nFamily/Dining Room - 9.19m x 7.67m\nDual aspect, timber flooring, t.v. point, double doors to patio and garden.\n\nKitchen - \nStremlined fitted kitchen, Quartz worktop, integrated sink unit, 5 ring hob, extractor fan over, fitted double oven, integrated fridge freezer and dishwasher, recessed lighting, tiled flooring.\n\nUtility Room - 3.69m x 1.92m\nRange of fitted units, worktop, shelving, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, fully tiled walls, tiled flooring, door to side.\n\nGuest W.C. - \nW.C., wash hand basin with illuminated mirror over, ceiling coving, recessed lighting, extractor fan, access to understairs storage, fully tiled walls, tiled flooring.\n\nStudy - 4.69m x 3.4m\nBespoke fitted units, bay window, timber flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting,\n\nLanding - 8.89m x 4.24m\nGallery landing overlooking the hall, bespoke fitted units, ceiling coving, timber flooring, ceiling coving, partly panelled walls, walk-in hotpress with shelving.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.76m x 4.55m\nRange of built-in wardrobes, timber effect flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting. Door to...\n\nEnsuite - 2.83m x 1.55m\nTiled shower unit, w.c., wash hand basin, illuminated mirror over, recessed lighting, extractor fan, fully tiled walls, tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.55m x 4.51m\nRange of built-in wardrobes, timber effect flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting.\n\nJack and Jill Ensuite - \nTiled shower unit, w.c., vanity unit with twin wash hand basins, illuminated mirror and light over, extractor fan, fully tiled walls, tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.51m x 3.63m\nRange of built-in wardrobes, timber effect flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.69m x 3.63m\nRange of built-in wardrobes, timber effect flooring, ceiling coving, recessed lighting.\n\nBathroom - 3.51m x 2.2m\nBath, separate shower unit, vanity unit with wash hand basin, recessed lighting, extractor fan, fully tiled walls, tiled flooring.\n\nStaircase to Second Floor - \n\n\nMaster Suite - \n\n\nBedroom - 6.93m x 4.07m\nLeading to dressing room and separate walk-in wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite - 3.2m x 2.9m\nFeature free standing bath, vanity unit with twin wash hand basins, illuminated mirror over, separate shower unit, w.c., heated towel rail, recesssed lighting, extractor fan, fully tiled walls, tiled flooring."
